    actual: 0.1d
    estimate: 1d
    accuracy: 0.14x
    gate: "7947 passed, 12 skipped, 0 failed in 789.45s -- DATABASE_URL UNSET, the then-current gate condition"
    note: "Removes the shared-database hazard that cost wave 44 a fix attempt. Its own three db_required tests are among those 12 skips, which is the evidence hole it exposed; the gate_condition_change below is what closes it."
